---
import AppPageShell from '../components/AppPageShell.astro';
---
<AppPageShell
  title="Privacy Policy and Data Protection | Pickupr"
  description="Read how Pickupr processes and protects customer data for booking, support, and service operations."
  canonical="/privacy-policy"
  structuredData={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'WebPage',
    name: 'Privacy Policy',
    url: 'https://pickupr.com/privacy-policy',
    inLanguage: 'en',
  }}
/>

<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-12 text-zinc-900">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-700">
    Pickupr processes personal data only for booking execution, customer support, invoicing, safety, and legal compliance.
    We do not sell personal data.
  </p>

  <section class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-zinc-700">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">What We Collect</h2>
    <p>Contact details, pickup and drop-off details, booking metadata, and communication history needed to provide service.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">How We Use Data</h2>
    <p>We use data to confirm rides, coordinate drivers, process payment, improve service quality, and prevent fraud.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Retention</h2>
    <p>Data is retained only as long as needed for service delivery, legal obligations, and financial recordkeeping.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can request access, correction, export, or deletion by contacting bookings@pickupr.com.</p>
  </section>
</main>
